    "updated_at": "2026-03-27T18:01:46Z",
    "body": "It would be interesting to have some example APIs that are impacted by this. Maybe it is everything that takes `Promise<T>` because that implicitly also takes `T`? But we already run JS at the IDL boundary so that seems like a case where maybe you don't need the delay.",
