    "body": "So spec verbiage, like the ['pause' steps here](https://drafts.csswg.org/web-animations-1/#animation-set-the-current-time) \n\n> [Resolve](https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#resolve) animation’s [current ready promise](https://drafts.csswg.org/web-animations-1/#current-ready-promise) with animation.\n\nis the kind of language that gets impacted ",
