    "created_at": "2026-03-27T21:40:06Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-27T21:40:06Z",
    "body": "As to test coverage... there is [some](https://github.com/tc39/proposal-thenable-curtailment/issues/7), but I would be deeply unsurprised to discover that it's heavily un-covered. \n\nI should also emphasize: There's a benefit to -specification authors- here too. It's equally easy or a specification to become incoherent in light of thenables; [ECMA262 has has this happen](https://github.com/tc39/ecma262/security/advisories/GHSA-g38c-wh3c-5h9r), and [Streams made updates to deal with this](https://github.com/whatwg/streams/pull/1326). ",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
