    "created_at": "2026-06-16T11:10:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-06-16T11:10:09Z",
    "body": "An update here: There's an experimental implementation in Firefox Nightly available if anyone would like to try it out. Set preference `dom.promise.experimental_safe_resolve` \n\nThe specification text is approximately correct at this point: https://tc39.es/proposal-thenable-curtailment/\n\nI'll be proposing this for stage 2.7 at the next TC39 meeting hopefully.\n\nIn terms of things which could be improved: The [previously linked streams change](https://github.com/whatwg/streams/pull/1326) could be partially reverted as it would be protecting against a state change which becomes impossible, ",
    "author_association": "NONE",
